        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Ancestral/scene_smoothsnake.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 486c204d-773b-4103-b4f4-829a3d944161).Image",
        "Description": "Months after Viktor Novikov&apos;s untimely demise, thanks to your handiwork 47, Sebastian Sato retired as a designer and focused on his second passion, botany. Today he is invited to participate as special guest at the Dartmoor Garden Show.\r\rBut his past simply refuses to let go. Our client, a former confidante of Viktor Nokivov, believes Sato is responsible for his former boss&apos; death and ultimately, the demise of Sanguine.\r\rOur client wants to make it look like an accident. Good luck 47!",
